  "title": "Quantum-Si Announces Inducement Grants Under Nasdaq Listing Rule 5635(c)(4)",
  "summary": "BRANFORD, Conn.–(BUSINESS WIRE)–Feb. 13, 2026– Quantum-Si Incorporated (Nasdaq: QSI) (“Quantum-Si,” “QSI” or the “Company”), a proteomics technology company redefining protein analysis through single-molecule detection, today announced that the Compensation Committee of Quantum-Si’s Board of Directors has granted 52,296 restricted stock units (“RSUs”) to new employees under the Company’s previously adopted Quantum-Si Incorporated 2023 Inducement Equity […]",
